{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the 17th century Caribbean and take the wheel of a ship as Captain George Somers, James Riskinner or Joseph Bannister, three historical figures\u00a0 during the &quot;Golden Age of Piracy&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/52552622bf215b55dd6e856a6e3e4009.avif?t=1764988613\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras_big/52552622bf215b55dd6e856a6e3e4009.avif?t=1764988613 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story is based at a different time, in a different settlement, from which you'll perform missions to upgrade your crew and ships and complete their historical accomplishments.\u00a0 \u00a0Each mission pits you against enemy vessels, ports and strongholds in pursuit of gold and plunder.\u00a0 Command up to four ships and engage in ship-vs-ship battles and crew-to-crew turn based combat when boarding ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/b22bd5a117d8c81ddf3ae622ebf32c2e.poster.avif?t=1764988613\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/b22bd5a117d8c81ddf3ae622ebf32c2e.webm?t=1764988613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/b22bd5a117d8c81ddf3ae622ebf32c2e.mp4?t=1764988613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George Somers faces the challenges of preparing a new ship for an arduous journey to finally deliver supplies and settlers to Jamestown, ten months after a\u00a0 hurricane left him marooned in Bermuda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James Riskinner seeks to amass a fortune in Spanish gold and goods, taken by force, or you'll die trying.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joseph Bannister committed treachery against Britain and then sailed with a group of Dutch privateers to raid the Spanish port of Campeche</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/fb86dd9c6699eb13c0ed773409537541.avif?t=1764988613\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras_big/fb86dd9c6699eb13c0ed773409537541.webp?t=1764988613 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620470?t=1764988613","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/87f6b85ba1789b905fad86875e1426ff028a4f53/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764988613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/f9278b764864eebfa4e089e3b066e5fdad0c044f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764988613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/f9278b764864eebfa4e089e3b066e5fdad0c044f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764988613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the 17th century Caribbean and take the wheel of a ship as Captain George Somers, James Riskinner or Joseph Bannister, three historical figures\u00a0 during the &quot;Golden Age of Piracy&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/52552622bf215b55dd6e856a6e3e4009.avif?t=1764988613\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras_big/52552622bf215b55dd6e856a6e3e4009.avif?t=1764988613 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each story is based at a different time, in a different settlement, from which you'll perform missions to upgrade your crew and ships and complete their historical accomplishments.\u00a0 \u00a0Each mission pits you against enemy vessels, ports and strongholds in pursuit of gold and plunder.\u00a0 Command up to four ships and engage in ship-vs-ship battles and crew-to-crew turn based combat when boarding ships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/b22bd5a117d8c81ddf3ae622ebf32c2e.poster.avif?t=1764988613\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/b22bd5a117d8c81ddf3ae622ebf32c2e.webm?t=1764988613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620470/extras/b22bd5a117d8c81ddf3ae622ebf32c2e.mp4?t=1764988613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >George Somers faces the challenges of preparing a new ship for an arduous journey to finally deliver supplies and settlers to Jamestown, ten months after a\u00a0 hurricane left him marooned in Bermuda.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >James Riskinner seeks to amass a fortune in Spanish gold and goods, 